    *   Click **Deploy** > **New deployment**.
    *   Select type: **Web app**.
    *   Description: "API v1".
    *   Execute as: **Me**.
    *   Who has access: **Anyone** (This is crucial for the fetch to work without OAuth complexity).
    *   Click **Deploy**.
