1.  **Stop generating fake data**: We will update the storage service to start with an empty list instead of "Seed Data".
2.  **Auto-Refresh**: We will add a "Listener" system. When the data finishes downloading from Google Sheets in the background, the app will automatically refresh itself to show the new data.

